<title>JAPAN: Tohoku Oil to close topper 60 days from mid-May.</title>
<headline>Tohoku Oil to close topper 60 days from mid-May.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tohoku Oil Co Ltd said on Friday it will close its 100,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Sendai refinery in northern Japan for about 60 days from mid-May for routine maintenance.</p>
<p>Tohoku Oil is owned 56.87 percent by Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd, 10 percent by trading house Mitsubishi Corp and the rest by several other companies.</p>
</text>
